 "about_text": "H Foundation for the Arts is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit arts platform based in San Marino, California, founded in 2025 by Tina He, growing out of the earlier Cultural Foundations of Zhendai He (USA). The organization continues a legacy of cultural research and international exchange inspired by scholar and educator Zhendai He. Through exhibitions, residencies, and public programs, it supports contemporary artists from Asia and its diaspora, fostering dialogue between tradition and contemporary expression across cultures and generations. Its programming is complemented by Be An Culture, a related media and storytelling platform connecting global Chinese-speaking communities through cultural dialogue and collaborative projects.",
